  "label": "Racial Stereotype: White People as Criminals",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that white people are more likely to be perceived as 'bad' or 'criminal' for the same actions as people of other races, thereby reinforcing racial bias and potentially contributing to racial profiling or discrimination. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is implied by the text 'when you are white and stole your first bike'.",
